# The application sources are never committed. Each Dockerfile clones its app
# from its fork while the image is built, and `make deps` clones a separate copy
# outside the repository (see DEPS_ROOT in the tool Makefiles), so the lines below
# only guard against a checkout landing in the build tree by accident.
metadavis/MetaDAVis/
microbiomeprofiler/MicrobiomeProfiler/
cminet/CMiNetShinyAPP/

# Scratch checkouts of a fork, used while developing an adaptation. Not a build
# input: the Dockerfiles clone from GitHub, so nothing here reaches an image.
local_*/

# Credentials for `make push_hub`
.password

# Galaxy / planemo run directories
*.log